# Development Plan (mandatory)

## Entry points

1. **What to build next** → `docs/DEVELOPMENT-PLAN.md` + `docs/PROGRESS.md`
2. **Backlog & dependencies** → `cursor-kit/plan/master-plan.yaml`
3. **Layer rules** → `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Rules

- **No code without SPEC** — v1 frozen; new work needs `status: ACTIVE` SPEC in `cursor-kit/specs/`
- **Update PROGRESS** when starting/finishing a Task
- **PLANNED specs** cannot spawn tasks until user approves (`approved: true` in master-plan)
- Phase 1 (ARCH-001~004) before feature sprawl in Phase 2+

## After each task

Update `docs/PROGRESS.md`, run validation from `project.config.yaml`, mark task done in progress tables.
